WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.290
Very little is currently known about what's
going down in Ghostbusters 2020, but the cast,

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.340
the early teasers and the franchise's enduring
legacy are more than enough to get excited

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:09.840
about.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.040
Here's what's in store.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:16.340
Unusual for a project of such size, things
came together very quickly for Ghostbusters

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.080
2020.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:22.060
In January 2019, the first reports of Jason
Reitman's involvement in a new Ghostbusters

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:26.640
film hit the headlines, followed the very
next day by a heavily nostalgic teaser trailer

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:27.200
for the movie.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.800
Then, before the end of the month, fans had
a release date to look forward to.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.600
Reitman confirmed via his Twitter account
that the film will hit theaters July 10th

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.600
2020, right in the prime of the summer movie
release season.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:43.620
Reitman has noted that the idea for his Ghostbusters
project began with the image of a 12-year-old

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:48.140
girl carrying a proton pack, and that image
ultimately expanded to include a whole family.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.739
Now, as the film draws closer, we're getting
a sense of what that family looks like - thanks

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.110
to its all-star cast.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:58.700
The 12-year-old in question will be played
by Mckenna Grace, a rising young talent who's

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.969
appeared in everything from Captain Marvel
to the Chilling Adventures of Sabrina to I,

00:01:02.969 --> 00:01:05.760
Tonya - and that's just in the last couple
of years.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:10.380
Presumably playing Grace's mother in the film
is Carrie Coon, who has appeared in TV series

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:15.360
such as Fargo and The Leftovers as well as
films such as Gone Girl and Avengers: Infinity

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:15.860
War.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:20.920
To play Coon's son, Grace's character's probable
brother, the film went with Finn Wolfhard,

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:26.030
best known to fans for his work as Mike Wheeler
on Stranger Things, as well as Richie Tozier

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:26.760
in the It movies.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:31.640
Finally, in June, word got out that comedy
superstar-turned-superhero Paul Rudd had also

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.540
joined the cast in the role of a teacher.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:39.320
So, a new cast is firmly in place for Ghostbusters
2020, but what about the cast of the original

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:39.820
film?

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:42.420
Well, this is where things get a little fuzzy.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:47.159
Back in June, Sigourney Weaver seemed to confirm
in an interview that she was indeed reprising

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.580
her role as Dana Barrett.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.120
Apparently referring to co-stars Bill Murray
and Dan Ayrkroyd, she said:

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.480
"It's going to be crazy working with the guys
again."

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.120
In the days following that report, Reitman
appeared at Ghostbusters Fan Fest and, rather

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:03.140
than confirming that the old stars would be
in the new movie, simply said that Weaver,

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:07.270
Murray, Ayrkroyd, and fellow co-star Ernie
Hudson had all read through the script.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:11.320
“If there’s a steady paycheck in it I’ll
believe anything you say.”

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:16.100
Odds are this does mean that the original
cast will come back in some form for the film,

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:20.020
particularly since everyone from Murray to
Annie Potts has expressed an interest in returning.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.920
"I love this plan!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.700
I’m excited to be a part of it!

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:24.700
Let’s do it!”

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.460
“This job is definitely not worth another
five a year!”

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:33.600
Jason Reitman's feature film directorial career
began in 2005 with the release of his debut

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.700
film, Thank You For Smoking.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:39.560
Since then he's become known for a particular
style that often walks the line between comedy

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:44.650
and drama, as seen in films like Juno, Up
in the Air, Tully, Young Adult, and most recently

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:45.500
The Front Runner.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:50.280
His films are often small in scale, more devoted
to exploring the intimacy and absurdity of

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:54.780
human relationships than big setpieces, and
his comedy usually evolves out of interactions

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:59.100
between characters rather than any deliberate
attempts to set up jokes and gags.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.140
"Did you see that comin’ when she sat us
down here?”

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:04.170
“Yeah, but I was hopin’ she was expelled
or into hard drugs.”

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.950
“That was my first instinct, too.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.260
Or a DWI, anything but this."

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:12.430
Though he's undoubtedly formed his own writing
and directing style over the years, Reitman's

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:14.480
interest in filmmaking has its roots in family.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:18.920
He is the son of actress Genevieve Robert
[and writer/director Ivan Reitman,

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:23.960
who's best known for his films Stripes, Kindergarten
Cop, and yes, Ghostbusters and Ghostbusters

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:24.460
II.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:28.820
The Ghostbusters franchise is woven into the
fabric of Reitman's life, so much so that

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:31.960
he even had a cameo in the second film back
in 1989.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.560
"You know, my dad says you guys are full of
crap.”

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:35.860
“Jason!”

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.220
“Well, some people have trouble believing
in the paranormal.”

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:41.520
“No, he just says you guys are full of crap
and that’s why you went out of business."

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:46.580
Very little has been shown of Ghostbusters
2020, but what has been released has consistently

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:48.180
leaned heavily on nostalgia.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:53.180
The first teaser, which arrived in January
2019, sets the scene spookily enough with

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:57.720
plenty of crazy lighting and strange goings-on,
before the welcome appearance of a familiar

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:58.260
friend.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:03.000
But apart from that teaser, all anyone has
to go on right now are a pair of photos Reitman

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.280
posted to his Instagram account from the set.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.950
One introduced fans to the new family at the
heart of the film, with Coon, Grace, and Wolfhard

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:12.880
joined by the two generations of Ghostbusters
directors.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:17.620
In the other, Reitman offered another look
at the ECTO-1, this time simply a close-up

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:18.620
of its wheel.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:23.560
Despite all the hype surrounding Ghostbusters
2020, very little is known about the film's

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.060
story.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:28.360
When Reitman's new take on Ghostbusters was
first announced, it was reported that the

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:32.560
film would be a continuation of the original
series, which would make it a direct, years-later

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:37.990
sequel to 1989's Ghostbusters II, ignoring
the controversial 2016 reboot.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:43.860
So, that means a world in which Peter Venkman,
Ray Stantz, Egon Spengler, and Winston Zeddemore

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:46.860
successfully saved New York from ghosts on
more than one occasion.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:51.020
Thanks to Reitman himself, it also seems clear
that the new story will center on family.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:56.220
Exact details about the movie's supporting
cast, villains, ghosts and actual plot, however,

00:04:56.220 --> 00:05:00.750
are still a mystery - and only time will tell
whether Reitman's movie will deliver the Ghostbusters

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.680
fans have been waiting for for over 30 years.

